# Accepted findings of the CI Trivy scans. Every entry needs a reason.

# DS-0002 "Dockerfile has no non-root USER":
# - frontend: the official nginx image starts its master as root (port 80, config
#   rendering) and runs the workers as the unprivileged "nginx" user.
# - backend: gunicorn still runs as root; switching needs a chown of the existing
#   "media" volume. Planned together with a read-only, capability-free container.
DS-0002
